2:T64c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between on-page SEO and technical SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Technical SEO deals with the infrastructure of your website — how search engines crawl it, index it and understand its structure. On-page SEO deals with the content on individual pages — keywords, copy, headers and internal linking. Both are required for rankings. Technical SEO without on-page optimization means a fast, crawlable site with no keyword relevance. On-page optimization without technical SEO means well-written content Google can't properly index."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you improve our rankings without rebuilding the website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — most technical and on-page SEO work is done within your existing CMS or website platform without redesign. We implement changes that improve performance without disrupting your site's appearance or user experience."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many pages do you optimize?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on your site size and the priority of each page. We typically start with your highest-traffic and highest-converting pages, then expand outward. Scope is agreed before work begins."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work with all website platforms?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We've implemented technical and on-page SEO across WordPress, Shopify, Webflow, Squarespace, Wix, HubSpot CMS, Drupal, custom platforms and enterprise CMS systems."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"On-Page & Technical SEO Services\",\"description\":\"Expert on-page SEO and technical SEO services for businesses of every size and industry. Keyword optimization, site architecture, Core Web Vitals and structured data — the foundations that rankings are built on.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/on-page-technical-seo\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-glow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"wrap","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"crumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/#services","children":"Digital Marketing"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"here","children":"On-Page & Technical SEO Services"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"svc-hero-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Technical SEO Agency"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"svc-title","style":{"marginTop":18},"children":"On-Page & Technical SEO Services"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"svc-lead","children":"On-page and technical SEO services are the twin foundations of organic search performance — and the reason most SEO programs plateau is that agencies treat them as separate services rather than one integrated system. Our on-page and technical SEO services ensure search engines can crawl, understand and index your site correctly, while simultaneously ensuring every page targets the right keywords with the right intent signals. Without on-page and technical SEO services working together, rankings stall regardless of content volume or link investment. Agentix provides on-page and technical SEO services as one integrated practice — across businesses of every size, platform and industry. Our on-page SEO services, website SEO audit and SEO optimization services are the implementation — delivered across businesses of every size, platform and industry."}],"$L4"]}],"$L5"]}]]}]]}],"$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]],null,"$Lf"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"R5AS-qKGsjGT-XLIKWTOn"}
